      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's definitely intentional, but is very misleading. With how it is laid out, a user would assume that worlds would display worlds, avatars would display avatars, and users would display users. Instead, it seems to work where both worlds and avatars displays worlds, and users displays users. This is confusing and unusual UI design, and avatars should be renamed to something like \"Avatar worlds\". This does also mean that \"Worlds\" would also need to be renamed to differentiate it from avatar worlds though.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
