      "mergeID": "65de0f95e0d145b423522b1d",
      "mergedPostDetails": "After searching, in Search Results > All > Top Results, avatar worlds have the `Avatar` tab. Scroll down a bit, there is also an `Avatars` catagory. Both strings should be changed to `Avatar Worlds` [23823] (or perhaps have a new `Avatar World` string for singular consistancy).\n\nThis would make it consistant with the \"VRCat's Variety Box\" page (under MM > Worlds > Featured Worlds). The two worlds also stand for different concepts, and should not be interchanged.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Change \"Avatar(s)\" to \"Avatar World(s)\" in Search Results",
